  clock: 4  # 058a
  nonce: 058a  # 058a
  message: "Fixed in PR #3368. Tier-scoped cross-tier reference validation: `_check_dangling_parents` -> `_check_ref_resolution` now checks all four ref-typed fields (parent, isbefore, duplicate_of, not_duplicate_of) with two index scopes — canonical/workspace items resolve in canonical-union-workspace (CI's view), stealth items resolve in the full local index. CLI write-time guard threaded through `tracker add`/`update` for --parent, --isbefore, --add-isbefore, --add-duplicate-of, --add-not-duplicate-of, --add-blocked-by. Removal flags skip the check (narrowing a ref set never creates a cross-tier link). Per-item structural validation unchanged. PR #3365's failure mode is now caught locally before push."  # 058a
